description	"Saul Karath 

Right Hand of Malak's New Sith Empire, Saul Kerath is a seasoned veteran of the Mandolorian Wars and Jedi Civil War.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Saul Karath's Sith Assassin Pistol (3)
-- Mag Reload
-- 15% faster Movement
-- Pulses and Cripples On Hit
-- 20% more Damage
-- 35% more FP Drain
-- 35% less RoF
-- 40% More Velocity
- Stun Baton (2)

^8Attributes:
- Sith Tablet (Tracking Beacon)
- 25% Faster Hacking
- Strict Regimen (Stat Viewer)
- Rally
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Strong Minded (Anti Mind Trick 2)
- Personal Guard (On Round Start Summon Sith Trooper Guard)

^3Abilities:
- Repremand (Resource/Block Point Dispenser 3) ^3[USE In Melee]
- Combat Stim ^3[CS4]
- Personal Sith Energy Shield ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Rally The Sith (Summon Sword Sith Trooper) ^3[CS3]"